    "title": "MyZio",
    "description": "MyZio\u00ae is the perfect companion app to the Zio\u00ae ECG monitor. Use the app to track your monitors shipping status, enter your symptoms, and access helpful information while wearing your Zio ECG monitor.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\u25e6 Signup for a MyZio account anytime\r\n\u25e6 Track your monitor\u2019s shipping status\r\n\u25e6 Seamlessly register your Zio ECG monitor and start logging symptoms.\r\n\u25e6 Enter your symptoms. View and edit your symptoms as needed.\r\n\u25e6 Access information about the Zio service. Instructional videos are included to help you throughout your Zio experience.\r\n\r\n*Features vary by market and country",
